When \`false\`, \`null\` and \`undefined\` are elided from the union so the underlying
primitive constructor is emitted, matching tsc with \`--strictNullChecks=false\`
and \`babel-plugin-transform-typescript-metadata\`.",
                  "type": "boolean",
